{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_037D80","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你父亲的事，真遗憾。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"谢谢……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>一直是我们<R=部队,FRENTE>的领袖。他是最后一代经历过Sandino将军时代的人……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\", \"<R=部队,FRENTE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":124,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>当年还是少年兵时，亲眼见证过将军的英姿。他经常给我讲……还有后来将军被暗杀时的事。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":142,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"你知道你父亲接受过KGB的资金援助吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"隐约知道……但我没有勇气去质问<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>。我想，对<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>来说，那也是个痛苦的决定。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\", \"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":137,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我想也是。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"是啊，<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>是个了不起的人。就算作为女儿，我也这么认为。伙伴们也很信赖他。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":121,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"正因为有<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>，即使日子再苦，<R=部队,FRENTE>也没有分崩离析。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\", \"<R=部队,FRENTE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"我真的能代替<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>吗……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":49,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"}]}